  "interpretation": "The eager-reflected arm retains all descriptors across GC. The forced-gc arm collects the weak caller and records the same missing metadata and stack signature as the source failure. The retained arm retains only parseCaller, not every weak stack frame, so the diagnostic reports not-reproduced for its stronger three-arm criterion. No complete retained-stack control is established.",
